    "temas": {
      "acesse": "OPEN THIS",
      "ano_todo": "This area stays live all year, with all of Season 1 unlocked for you, and it keeps getting updated. If now isn't the time to record, come back later: there'll be something new waiting.",
      "itens": {
        "autor": {
          "nome": "The creator's story",
          "fala": "Isaias Leal spent almost 10 years in the games industry, worked on FNAF: Into the Pit and God of War: Sons of Sparta, and shipped over 50 titles. He left to build, on his own, a universe he's been writing since he was 17. Great for behind-the-scenes, career and indie dev channels, and for anyone who likes stories about people who bet everything on one project."
        },
        "personagens": {
          "nome": "The characters' lives",
          "fala": "Each main character has a past told separately: Nina, adopted at 3; Jack, on his own from a very young age, making bike deliveries to get by. Good for analysis, theories and \"who's who\" videos before reading."
        },
        "contos": {
          "nome": "A tale to start with",
          "fala": "If you want a self-contained story, pick a tale. Alan, the Champion shows Marelia's organized crime. Sonata of a Fight is short and direct. The Chains explains Kim's power. All of them are open now."
        },
        "principal": {
          "nome": "The main story",
          "fala": "The main line is Illusion Fight: Kim, Jack and Nina in a world where fights happen in a simulator and the pain is real. You get 12 book chapters and every webtoon chapter finished before launch. Great for read-alongs and first impressions."
        },
        "temporada": {
          "nome": "Season 1 and the schedule",
          "fala": "Season 1 starts November 15, 2026, with chapters releasing in sequence. After every three months of releases there's a one-month hiatus, the rest month. That month brings extra content from the same author: The Shadow World and Sea of Ashes. That's why they live next to the main line: there's always a new story, and you have something to cover all year."
        },
        "games": {
          "nome": "Games",
          "fala": "Three complete, free browser games: LDI Gangues (gang brawls across the city), Lendas do LDI (your Vein changes the story) and Top Trumps with an online mode. Good for gameplay, audience challenges and Steam Next Fest coverage."
        },
        "musica": {
          "nome": "Music",
          "fala": "The universe has an original soundtrack playing on Radio Nina inside the site. There's also a whole tale about Kim and Jack's band. Works for music channels, soundtrack reacts and streams with background music."
        },
        "universo": {
          "nome": "The whole universe",
          "fala": "Three universes by the same author: Illusion Fight (action), The Shadow World (horror) and Sea of Ashes (dark fantasy). Good for lore, comparison and worldbuilding videos."
        }
      },
